OL,3,GNEWSACriminal charges considered over
OL,4,A'spycops' scandal
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn undercover policeman who infiltrated
OL,7,Fa Nottingham-based climate protest
OL,8,Fgroup could face prosecution.
OL,10,FMark Kennedy formed intimate
OL,11,Frelationships with a number of women
OL,12,Fover several years while he posed as an
OL,13,Factivist under the alias Mark Stone.
OL,15,FHis unmasking in 2010 eventually led to
OL,16,Fa wider undercover policing scandal and
OL,17,Fan ongoing public inquiry.
