OL,3,GNEWSACriminal charges considered over
OL,4,A'spycops' scandal
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe National Police Chiefs' Council
OL,7,F(NPCC) has confirmed that evidence
OL,8,Frelating to Kennedy and 11 other
OL,9,Fofficers has now been sent to the Crown
OL,10,FProsecution Service.
